---
# 理由同 sitemap.xml：permalink 写死，路径才与 baseurl 对齐、才不会被
# 「没显式声明 permalink 的页面拿到无扩展名 page.url」那一类坑咬到。
permalink: /manifest.json
---
{%- comment -%}
Web App Manifest。sw.js 已经能跑，差的就是这一个文件；补上才拿到「可安装」这个能力位。

文件名用 manifest.json 而不是 manifest.webmanifest：后者要 CDN 认
application/manifest+json 这个 MIME 才生效，而 GitHub Pages 的 MIME 表在部署前
验不了——猜错的表现是安装面静默失效，连一条控制台报错都不给。manifest.json
在任何静态托管上都是 application/json，Chrome 照单全收。零风险的那头。

icons 的地址不在这里写第二遍：_data/manifestIcons.yml 是
scripts/build-manifest-icons.mjs 的唯一出口，head.html 的 apple-touch-icon
也查同一张表。where: 'use', 'manifest' 把只服务 iOS 主屏的 180 那枚挡在外面。

刻意不写 orientation：锁定竖屏对一个要读长文与表格的站是减分项，
横屏看代码块本来就是正当用法，让设备自己决定。
{%- endcomment -%}
{
  "name": {{ site.title | jsonify }},
  "short_name": "Better",
  "description": {{ site.description | jsonify }},
  "lang": "zh-CN",
  "start_url": "{{ '/' | absolute_url }}",
  "scope": "{{ '/' | absolute_url }}",
  "display": "standalone",
  "categories": ["news", "productivity", "education"],
  "screenshots": [
    {
      "src": "{{ '/assets/img/pwa/home-1280x720.png' | absolute_url }}",
      "sizes": "1280x720",
      "type": "image/png",
      "form_factor": "wide",
      "label": "首页：前端与 AI 长文"
    },
    {
      "src": "{{ '/assets/img/pwa/tools-390x844.png' | absolute_url }}",
      "sizes": "390x844",
      "type": "image/png",
      "form_factor": "narrow",
      "label": "工具箱：三款 Chrome 插件"
    }
  ],
  "shortcuts": [
    {
      "name": "工具箱",
      "short_name": "工具箱",
      "description": "三款 Chrome 插件与四款免安装工具",
      "url": "{{ '/tools.html' | absolute_url }}"
    },
    {
      "name": "阅读报告",
      "short_name": "报告",
      "description": "这台设备的阅读记录与连续天数",
      "url": "{{ '/stats.html' | absolute_url }}"
    },
    {
      "name": "全站索引",
      "short_name": "索引",
      "description": "按年份列全部文章",
      "url": "{{ '/index-all.html' | absolute_url }}"
    }
  ],
  "background_color": "#FAF9F6",
  "theme_color": "#FAF9F6",
  "icons": [
{%- assign _icons = site.data.manifestIcons.icons | where: 'use', 'manifest' -%}
{%- for ic in _icons %}
    { "src": "{{ ic.path | absolute_url }}", "sizes": "{{ ic.sizes }}", "type": "image/png", "purpose": "any" }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
{%- endfor %}
  ]
}
